              </div>
      
            
    
    <div id="edit-group-study-abroad--content" class="panel-body panel-collapse collapse fade">
            
            <div class="field field--name-dynamic-block-fieldnode-scheda-cds-studi-estero field--type-ds field--label-hidden field--item"><div class="views-element-container form-group"><div class="view view-w4-cdsi-to-node view-id-w4_cdsi_to_node view-display-id-block_9 js-view-dom-id-d0edd2d01e4e979d062707241e48215b03ab219c4c1168a7efc73e1932c1b684">
  
    
      
      <div class="view-content">
          <div class="views-row"><div class="views-field views-field-field-esperienze-estero"><div class="field-content"><p>Per le iniziative internazionali si rimanda al <a href="https://www.unimib.it/triennale/lingua-segni-italiana-tattile">sito del corso</a>&nbsp;(Università Bicocca).</p></div></div></div>

